334
00:20:31,820 --> 00:20:34,560
A specific, documented, human explanation,

335
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:37,320
or an honest, official verdict of unknown.

336
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:42,240
Not one of them, not a single case in 80 years of records,

337
00:20:42,440 --> 00:20:44,240
ever ended in anything paranormal.

338
00:20:45,100 --> 00:20:46,580
Unknown does not mean unexplainable.

339
00:20:46,580 --> 00:20:48,700
It means the wreckage was never recovered.

340
00:20:50,200 --> 00:20:51,960
The real danger was never this water.

341
00:20:52,420 --> 00:20:55,640
It was how easily a manufactured mystery outlives the boring,

342
00:20:55,860 --> 00:21:00,280
